{"title":"Career Roadmap: BI Executive","role":"BI Executive","summary":"A BI Executive converts organizational data into useful business information through data analysis, dashboards, reporting, KPI tracking and decision support.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA","Course":"Data Science / Analytics"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build skills to transform business data into dashboards, reports, KPIs and actionable insights"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A BI Executive converts organizational data into useful business information through data analysis, dashboards, reporting, KPI tracking and decision support."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between business teams, databases and analytics teams."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong BI Executive should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business requirements"},{"text":"Data collection and preparation"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Dashboard development"},{"text":"Business analysis"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Automation"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Programming + Excel"},{"text":"Python, Excel, statistics"},{"text":"Small data-analysis projects"},{"text":"Only learning programming syntax"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"SQL + databases"},{"text":"MySQL/PostgreSQL, data modelling"},{"text":"SQL portfolio"},{"text":"Weak database fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"BI + analytics"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau, DAX, ETL"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"},{"text":"Making dashboards without business logic"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"t