ss Intelligence Concepts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete BI pipeline:"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Sources"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Extraction"},{"type":"h","text":"ETL/ELT"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Warehouse"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Model"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Decision"},{"type":"p","text":"A BI Executive should understand why the dashboard exists, not simply how to create visualizations."}]},{"heading":"KPI & Business Metrics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how KPIs differ by business function."},{"type":"h","text":"Sales"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Sales growth"},{"text":"Average order value"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Win rate"},{"text":"Sales target achievement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leads"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Operating expenses"},{"text":"EBITDA"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Budget variance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Utilization"},{"text":"SLA achievement"},{"text":"Defect rate"},{"text":"Cycle time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headcount"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Absenteeism"},{"text":"Hiring time"},{"text":"Employee retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"E-commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"AOV"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Cart abandonment"},{"text":"Repeat purchase"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"}]}]},{"heading":"Statistics for BI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"You do not need advanced mathematical statistics for most BI Executive roles, but you should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Mode"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Basic regression"},{"text":"A/B testing concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use statistics to determine whether a business change is meaningful rather than simply reporting numbers."}]},{"heading":"Data Cleaning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Duplicate records"},{"text":"Invalid dates"},{"text":"Incorrect data types"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Inconsistent categories"},{"text":"Incorrect joins"},{"text":"Null foreign keys"},{"text":"Duplicate customers"},{"text":"Data-entry errors"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"Garbage in → garbage out."},{"type":"p","text":"Dashboard quality depends heavily on data quality."}]},{"heading":"Data Warehousing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OLTP vs OLAP"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Data marts"},{"text":"ETL vs ELT"},{"text":"Fact tables"},{"text":"Dimension tables"},{"text":"Slowly changing dimensions"},{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Snowflake schema"},{"text":"Data lakes"},{"text":"Lakehouses"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Cloud platforms to explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Fabric"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You don't need expertise in all three cloud platforms."}]},{"heading":"Python for BI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Python should support your BI workflow rather than replace BI tools."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Seaborn"},{"text":"SciPy basics"},{"te