SQL generation"},{"text":"Dashboard creation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Predictive BI"},{"type":"p","text":"BI professionals will increasingly combine historical reporting with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Risk prediction"},{"text":"Customer churn"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Scenario modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semantic Layers"},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding business definitions and governed metrics will become increasingly important so that organizations have a consistent definition of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Customer"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Active user"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"Future BI professionals should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Data lineage"},{"text":"Access control"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"AI governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role therefore evolves from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Create reports\""},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Build trusted data-driven decision systems.\""}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business fundamentals"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Requirement gathering"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"},{"text":"Data storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Forecasting fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"PostgreSQL/MySQL"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Data warehousing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"BI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Row-level security"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},